// 11 - DESIGN AREAS
// ONE FLOOR, TWO BRANCH LINES OF FOUR K80 SPRINKLERS, AND A HOSE REEL.
// THE MODEL HOLDS EVERY SPRINKLER; EACH AREA NAMES THE ONES THAT FLOW
// TOGETHER.  THE HOSE REEL IS IN NO AREA, SO IT FLOWS IN EVERY AREA.
// PHCP SOLVES EACH AREA AND REPORTS THE ONE THAT GOVERNS: HERE FAR, AT
// THE END OF THE LONGER, SMALLER MAIN.

TITLE     DESIGN AREAS EXAMPLE
UNITS     FLOW LPM
UNITS     PRESSURE KPA
UNITS     LENGTH M
UNITS     SIZE MM
UNITS     ELEVATION M
UNITS     KFACTOR LPM/BAR

WATER     TOWN 0 450 1000 380 2000 250

NODE      R0 0
NODE      R1 4
NODE      J1 4
NODE      J2 4
SPRINKLER A1 4 -100 80
SPRINKLER A2 4 -100 80
SPRINKLER A3 4 -100 80
SPRINKLER A4 4 -100 80
SPRINKLER B1 4 -100 80
SPRINKLER B2 4 -100 80
SPRINKLER B3 4 -100 80
SPRINKLER B4 4 -100 80
HREEL     HR1 1 20 30

USE       ASAM
PIPE      M1 TOWN R0 30 100
PIPE      RS R0 R1 4 100 E
PIPE      H1 R1 J1 10 80 T
PIPE      H2 J1 J2 40 80
PIPE      HRP R0 HR1 5 25

USE       ASAM
PIPE      LA1 J1 A1 3 65 T
PIPE      LA2 A1 A2 3 50
PIPE      LA3 A2 A3 3 40
PIPE      LA4 A3 A4 3 32
PIPE      LB1 J2 B1 3 65 T
PIPE      LB2 B1 B2 3 50
PIPE      LB3 B2 B3 3 40
PIPE      LB4 B3 B4 3 32

AREA      NEAR A1 A2 A3 A4
AREA      FAR B1 B2 B3 B4
AREA      MIDDLE A3 A4
AREA      MIDDLE B1 B2
